OL,3,GNEWSAMan remains in custody after fatal
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,7,Fremains in custody following a
OL,8,Fstabbing, police say.
OL,10,FEmergency crews were flagged down at
OL,11,F23:15 GMT on Sunday after a man was
OL,12,Ffound unconscious on Stonehouse High
OL,13,FStreet, Gloucestershire Police said.
OL,14,FThe force said he died at the scene.
OL,16,FAbout 15 minutes later, a car was
OL,17,Fdriven into a garden wall and the
OL,18,Fdriver fled, police said. Officers then
OL,19,Freceived a report that he had tried to
OL,20,Fforce entry into a property in Cam and
OL,21,Fassaulted two people inside.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
