OL,3,GNEWSAMan remains in custody after fatal
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s from Stonehouse was
OL,7,Fdetained and later arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of murder. Gloucestershire
OL,9,FPolice said it was not looking for
OL,10,Fanyone else in relation to the
OL,11,Fincidents.
